@James Stephens II -  This is an empty state on the History page, for new users that have not imported browsing history. 

As for defining "new", I am recommending it to mean a profile age of 7 or fewer days, which I arrived at based on anecdotal info from Ania about import behavior (that it likely usually happens within the first day or two. As that team gets set up with telemetry and a dashboard, we can review and adjust this timing if / as needed. 

Please let myself and @Amy Lee know if any concerns with this.

@Eric Pang FYI updated this spec with the formatting we agreed on.
